{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51061","headline":"石刻诗（幷序） · 陈抟","name":"石刻诗（幷序）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我谓浮荣真是幻，醉来舍辔谒高公。\n因聆玄论冥冥理，转觉尘寰一梦中。\n（见《宋诗纪事》卷五引《老学庵笔记》。\n）（见《老学庵笔记》卷六。\n末附引文有删节。\n）（〖1〗《老学庵笔记》：卭州天庆观石刻希夷诗云云。\n末书太岁丁酉，盖蜀孟昶时，当石晋天福中也。\n文与可跋云：「高公者，此观都威仪何昌一也，希夷从之学锁鼻术。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈抟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51061.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51061","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}